@startuml
title LAB3 创建预订时序：SQLite事务与幂等结果
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
actor 顾客
participant SearchPage
participant BookingService
participant CommandExecutor
participant AuthService
participant PricingService
participant InventoryService
database SQLite
顾客 -> SearchPage : 接受报价并提交
SearchPage -> BookingService : create(token, command, key)
BookingService -> CommandExecutor : execute(..., apply)
CommandExecutor -> SQLite : BEGIN IMMEDIATE
CommandExecutor -> AuthService : resolve(connection, token)
CommandExecutor -> SQLite : 按操作者/操作/键读取request_record
alt 同键、同内容
  CommandExecutor --> BookingService : 原结果
else 同键、不同内容
  CommandExecutor --> BookingService : REQUEST_KEY_CONFLICT
else 新请求
  CommandExecutor -> SQLite : SAVEPOINT business
  CommandExecutor -> BookingService : apply(connection, actor)
  BookingService -> PricingService : calculate(connection, ...)
  PricingService -> SQLite : 读取酒店、房型、全部住宿夜
  BookingService -> BookingService : 校验权限、容量和已接受报价
  BookingService -> InventoryService : replace({}, new)
  InventoryService -> SQLite : 按序更新reserved，检查supply/停售
  BookingService -> SQLite : INSERT booking / booking_night / audit_log
  BookingService --> CommandExecutor : 订单结果
  CommandExecutor -> SQLite : RELEASE + INSERT request_record + COMMIT
end
CommandExecutor --> BookingService : 结果或业务错误
BookingService --> SearchPage : 订单
SearchPage --> 顾客 : 显示成功
note over CommandExecutor,SQLite
业务错误：回滚SAVEPOINT，保存失败结果后提交。
SQLite/OSError：整事务回滚，不缓存基础设施错误。
end note
@enduml
